 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The synopsis",
     "texto": [
      "A **sinopsis** summarizes the main plot without telling every detail. It can mention the setting, the conflict and the climax.",
      "**Berdasarkan** introduces the source of a story: **film berdasarkan kisah nyata** (\"film based on a true story\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The confix meng-..-i",
     "texto": [
      "In some words, **meng-..-i** has a causative meaning: **menakuti penonton** (\"to scare the audience\"). In others, it indicates an action directed at a place: **mengunjungi desa** (\"to visit a village\"). The meaning depends on the word; don't translate the suffix in only one way."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
